OL,3,AUK will have 'voice' but no vote on EU
OL,4,Afood rules in Brexit reset
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK will have a "voice in the room"
OL,7,Fbut no vote on European Union food
OL,8,Fpolicies as part of a so-called "Brexit
OL,9,Freset" to reduce red tape, EU relations
OL,10,Fminister Hamish Falconer has told the
OL,11,FBBC.
OL,13,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham hopes to
OL,14,Fagree a deal at a summit on Friday but
OL,15,Fcritics have said a reset will make the
OL,16,FUK "a rule taker" but not a rule maker.
OL,18,FFalconer said the UK will be involved
OL,19,Fin a process to shape the rules and
OL,20,Fsaid the deal could help bring down
OL,21,Fprices for shoppers.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,107,105,200,300,0,100
